Funeral contracts-investment and bonding
HB0181
requirements.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Larsen, L, Brown, L, Knapp and
Washut and Senator(s) Schuler
AN ACT relating to insurance; amending investment authorization for prepaid or
prearranged funeral contract proceeds; amending related surety bond provisions;
specifying application of purchase monies and investment earnings; requiring
notice to contract purchasers; and providing for effective dates.
